WEBVTT

00:00.800 --> 00:04.200
Most people pick a lane. I built four.

00:04.200 --> 00:08.000
I am Md Shafaat Ali Choyon. I started with

00:08.000 --> 00:13.500
80,000 customer conversations, learning why people say yes,

00:13.500 --> 00:21.500
and I grew into sixteen years driving growth across telecom, advertising, fintech, tech and education.

00:22.000 --> 00:27.500
And then the pandemic showed me growth means more when it changes someone's life.

00:28.000 --> 00:33.000
Thus, I earned public health credentials to do it right.

00:33.000 --> 00:37.000
One career, four lenses. Pick yours. Something tells me

00:37.000 --> 00:43.000
we are going to be having a conversation, and I promise, it's going to be a good one.
